# ============================================
# IMPORTANT: Keep these files tracked!
# ============================================
# *.sln (Solution file - needed to open project)
# *.csproj / *.vbproj (Project files - needed to build)
# *.config (But NOT *.exe.config or connection strings with passwords)
# *.cs / *.vb (Source code files)
# *.resx (Resource files)
# *.xaml (WPF files if added later)
# *.sql (SQL script files you want versioned)